1
00:00:03,303 --> 00:00:05,238
Why did he react like that?

2
00:00:05,238 --> 00:00:06,206
Did you see it?

3
00:00:06,206 --> 00:00:07,273
I said, did you see it?

4
00:00:07,273 --> 00:00:09,209
Was the advance payment
a sign of his feelings?

5
00:00:10,577 --> 00:00:12,545
And what is he doing there?

6
00:00:14,347 --> 00:00:15,615
Is he monitoring me?

7
00:00:16,816 --> 00:00:18,385
I'm getting a headache
over here.

8
00:00:19,319 --> 00:00:21,121
Should I test him out?

9
00:00:27,761 --> 00:00:29,162
What are you two doing?

10
00:00:29,162 --> 00:00:30,864
- Oh, I thought...
- I was right.

11
00:00:30,864 --> 00:00:31,865
He has feelings for me.

12
00:00:31,865 --> 00:00:32,905
That was a bit misleading.

13
00:00:33,299 --> 00:00:36,736
Excuse me, something
just came up.

14
00:00:37,203 --> 00:00:39,205
Hye-won!

15
00:00:39,205 --> 00:00:41,241
Hye-won!

16
00:00:42,675 --> 00:00:43,777
What was that?

17
00:00:43,877 --> 00:00:45,178
You're not like that.

18
00:00:45,478 --> 00:00:47,814
If someone gets the wrong idea
like the boss said...

19
00:00:50,683 --> 00:00:51,683
Is this what it's about?

20
00:00:52,919 --> 00:00:54,821
I'm really sorry.

21
00:00:56,156 --> 00:00:57,516
Please don't tell this
to the boss.
